The Tidereader's Rest is a saloon in the southern end of [[Geography/Althane/Salores/Toleros/index|Toleros]]. Mostly catering to travelers and adventurers not part of [[Org/Althane/The Guild|the Guild]], the store offers cheap beds, acceptable beer, and a pretty good view of Toleros' water channels.
